# Astro conventions (this repo)

- Astro **7**, static output. Tailwind via `@tailwindcss/vite` in `astro.config.mjs` — not `@astrojs/tailwind`.
- i18n: `defaultLocale: 'ru'`, locales `ru`/`de`, `prefixDefaultLocale: false` → `/` and `/de/`.
- Locale helpers: `src/i18n/ui.ts` (locales + barrel), `src/i18n/ru.ts` / `src/i18n/de.ts` (strings), `src/i18n/utils.ts`. Layout uses `Astro.currentLocale` via `resolveLocale`.
- **Approved facts:** Angerhauser Str. 91, 47259 Duisburg Süd; Sunday 15:00; fonts Marck Script / Yeseva One / Cormorant Garamond in `public/fonts/` (no Google Fonts CDN).
- **Do not invent** Impressum PII (name e.V., Vertretung, email, phone, VR) or finalize Datenschutz legal claims — placeholders only.
- Hero: `HeroScrub.astro` — ScrollTrigger **pin** (not CSS sticky) + canvas WebP scrub; early mobile `innerHeight` lock via inline script. + React overlay `Hero.tsx`. Frames in `public/animation/`.
- Header is `fixed`; home is full-bleed (`body.is-home`); inner pages pad `main` with `--site-header-h`.
- Reveal: GSAP ScrollTrigger scrub (`html.reveal-gsap`) on all devices — blur/scale/opacity. CSS `view()` pattern in `global.css` = no-JS fallback only.
- Embeds: 2-Click YouTube / external Maps only (`src/components/embeds/`).
- Typecheck: `npm run check-types` → `astro check`.
- Lint: Sonar-style limits (depth≤3, fn≤20, complexity, no-`any`).
- Host: Vercel + `@vercel/analytics` + `@astrojs/vercel` (`imageService: true`).
- Scroll: Lenis `autoRaf: false` synced to GSAP ticker in `Layout.astro`.
- **Deps / new modules:** always check [astro.build/integrations](https://astro.build/integrations/) before adding packages; prefer Official / existing repo solutions over duplicates.
